tv/31665/season/2/episode/16"},{"id":"757958","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"La fuga di Eri","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Nakamura sees Eri ride away with Harima, but he cant catch them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-07-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4Z0JfcEAmlGoxbjvfsyDHWRN90K.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4Z0JfcEAmlGoxbjvfsyDHWRN90K.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31665/season/2/episode/17"},{"id":"757959","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Dolci trappole","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Eri tells Mikoto about how she stayed together with Harima under a single blanket at the temple.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5Sn2i41Dy5VJ2vpz3JiFuoGaZPX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Sn2i41Dy5VJ2vpz3JiFuoGaZPX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31665/season/2/episode/18"},{"id":"757961","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Ovunque è Natale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Finally finished with his manuscript, Harima wants to have Tenma to read it first.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pwSBfQP70HdQYlFWBXKgFNamTgd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pwSBfQP70HdQYlFWBXKgFNamTgd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31665/season/2/episode/19"},{"id":"757962","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Più che amici, meno che fidanzati","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"This act starts out with Karens brother, Kousuke pestering a very tired Karen while she is brushing her teeth.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dpibymQnhjTKkY8RbWxMMw019Wn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dpibymQnhjTKkY8RbWxMMw019Wn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31665/season/2/episode/20"},{"id":"757963","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"School Rumble","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It's School Rumble: My Mai Dream! Mai, the princess of the Magical Realm, wants to use the rare blue Damask rose to make Masked Kamen fall for her, but The Evil Cartoon King kidnapped him! It's up to Mai to save the day.\n\nit's Really School Rumble: The Perverted Cartoon King is in his castle, and Mai, with the help of Karasuma, succeeds in breaking in. But why is the Cartoon King doing this? And what lies underneath Karasuma's school uniform?\n\nI said it's School Rumble: Turns out The Evil Perverted Cartoon Kings has a heart after all! But magical love is no love at all, Mai. The true identity of Masked Kamen is revealed! Just remember, it's still School Rumble.\n\nDoraibu is good, but it's still not School Rumble.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ec1t2s1td9Fn9jjLOaGRkaKzAVi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ec1t2s1td9Fn9jjLOaGRkaKzAVi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31665/season/2/episode/21"},{"id":"757964","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Anno nuovo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Phantom has found a worthy opponent.\n\nFirst Dream: It's not the first time Harima had dreamt about Tenma accepting his love but this is the first dream of the new year, which means it will come true! If that is true, then why is Tenma praying with Karasuma, while Harima is stuck with Eri?\n\nLion Dance: Harima and Eri are assigned for the traditional Lion Dance. But Harima must follow Tenma! The people of Japan just aren't used to see a giant Lion roaming the streets.\n\nNew Year: People do many things on New Year's Day in Japan. They fly kites, play games, and beat up Imadori.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c0YDcpdFUyHVwnzrjOxjrp5ZyXi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c0YDcpdFUyHVwnzrjOxjrp5ZyXi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31665/season/2/episode/22"},{"id":"757966","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Grandi sogni","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tenma decides it's time to lose some weight yeah, right.\n\nJumbo Dream : Tenma and her friends have gone skiing, while Itoko and her friend have gone to Okinawa. But with a 30 page script to write and no money at all, Harima can only gaze from afar\n\nDream Jump: Everybody has a shocking side- Tenma is great at ski, and Karasuma likes to dress as a snowman. Not to mention Ichijou's great ice skating skills. Now Lala is envious.\n\nDream Express: Yakumo is all alone, and isn't feeling well. Harima is all alone, too. Can a giraffe help them both?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vC8UYPL6QQ4VbD5FbQ7120GFmBn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vC8UYPL6QQ4VbD5FbQ7120GFmBn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31665/season/2/episode/23"},{"id":"757965","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"L'isola misteriosa","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"All the students of 2-C go on Eri's cruise through the Pacific for their winter vacation. They eventually hit a reef and the engine breaks down, leaving them stranded. Hanai flies on his kite to an island populated by what seems to be a Mesoamerican civilization, featuring familiar faces.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dELZ3pwOIKDrPBhWQJ8mZjcQr4M.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dELZ3pwOIKDrPBhWQJ8mZjcQr4M.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31665/season/2/episode/24"},{"id":"757967","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Harima il romanticone","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Harima gets unexpected assistance from Tenma for his manga, increasing their bond. Yakumo remembers a book from her childhood.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mdymmk9iKicNwD09E4padwMy9y7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mdymmk9iKicNwD09E4padwMy9y7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31665/season/2/episode/25"},{"id":"757968","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Un'altra occasione per Harima","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Harima has his best chance yet to confess to Tenma.\n\nThere are big news about Karasuma.\n\nYakumo is visited again by the ghost girl, who interrogates her about her feelings for Harima. Flashbacks reveal Yakumo's relationship with Tenma as children, when Yakumo's character was quite different. We learn the importance of the children's book.\n\nThe third term starts, and Harima has to decide whether to stay at school or not.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/thf6LHoDWxKHCo9UtmWCufM0oQt.jpg","stills":[{"type